"""Typed stub for the compiled `quadraui._quadraui` native extension
(`quadraui-py/src/lib.rs`, built by `maturin`), covering every `#[pymethods]`/
`#[pyfunction]` it exports.

`quadraui/__init__.py` re-exports this whole module's public API, and
`quadraui/py.typed` (PEP 561) tells a type checker to follow imports *into*
this package rather than silently skip it -- which means it now has to
resolve `quadraui._quadraui` too, and a compiled `.so`/`.pyd` has nothing
for a checker to read. Without this file a strict `mypy`/`pyright` run
against anything importing `quadraui` fails on `__init__.py`'s own `from
._quadraui import (...)` line with "Cannot find implementation or library
stub for module", before it even reaches application code.

Generated by `scripts/gen_wire_types.py` from the `#[pymethods]`/`#[pyfunction]` declarations in `quadraui-py/src/lib.rs` -- do not hand-edit; re-run that script instead.
"""

